    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a brutal way to put it. \"a hollow shell\"... it feels like that. like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. if i'm already basically gone to everyone else, what's even the point of staying? it just feels like i'm waiting for something that's never coming back.",
